sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Workflow
  participant Config
  participant UI
  participant Accountant
  participant API
  participant Policy
  participant Audit
  Workflow->>Config: Propose supported target settings
  Config->>UI: Impact, evidence and required approval
  Accountant->>API: Approve or reject current proposal
  API->>Policy: Owner, scope, version and prerequisite guards
  Policy->>Config: Apply approved deterministic setting only
  Config->>Audit: Record setting version and actor
  Config->>UI: Configured or blocked; no premature FPU
